        <div class="tag-row">
          {branch.tags.map((tag) => <span class="tag-pill">{tag}</span>)}
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2 id="specialisation-pays-more">Why specialists can out-earn generalist HRBPs</h2>
  <p>
    This is the part of the HR career path in India salary growth story most generic advice skips
    entirely: at the senior end, specialisation frequently beats generalist HRBP or even CHRO pay,
    because compensation and analytics-heavy branches combine HR judgment with a scarce quantitative
    skill set that fewer HR professionals actually build.
  </p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Specialised role</th>
          <th>Typical pay range</th>
          <th>What drives the premium</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
